# GOLDEN RA RB OVERLAPPING
# GOLDEN-SUBSET RA RB YES
# GROUND-TRUTH: the companion of presence_05. With a filter that a missing
#   dxy makes FALSE, membership in `picky` PROVES dxy present, so EPRES fires
#   and `RA within RB` is derivable — and TRUE: every event with a picky
#   electron has one whose dxy passed `> 2`, hence `>= -1000`. An electron
#   with no dxy is In NEITHER region (it does not pass the filter), verified
#   with `smash2 run`.
#
#   This is the precision half of the EPRES story: the guards Phase B put on
#   ORD/IDOM/NNEG/TAG are discharged exactly here, by unit propagation, which
#   is why guarding cost zero corpus proofs.

object picky
  take Ele
  select dxy > 2

region RA
  select size(picky) >= 1

region RB
  select dxy(picky[0]) >= -1000
